<title>FINLAND: CULTOR 1996 PROFIT FALLS 21 PCT.</title>
<headline>CULTOR 1996 PROFIT FALLS 21 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   391 vs 494</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  12.71 vs 14.91</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    5.00 vs 5.00</p>
<p> Net sales					  8,362 vs 6,201</p>
<p> Operating profit				   545 vs 528</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 154 vs 34 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary income				 4 vs 10</p>
<p> Extraordiary expenses			     13 vs 19</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes		381 vs 485</p>
<p> Taxes						   77 vs 125</p>
<p> Minorities				   charge 20 vs 25 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					   283 vs 335</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish sweetener, feeds and bakery</p>
<p>group is Cultor Oy.</p>
